      "cooked": "<p>Happy they raised that extra 120k, as they deserve it fair and square for composing, once again, a wonderful Kickstarter!</p>\n<p>Hats off to &gt;G for making excellent estimations on fundable content regarding the expansion and add-on packages, as they fleshed out wonderfully  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"> .</p>",
